BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Half Price Tacos and House Margs at Yellow Door Taqueria!
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260731
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260801
DTSTAMP:20260922T150937Z
UID:e0d95b06c7be4290562a81ad7ad5@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Join us EVERY DAY at Yellow Door Taqueria from 3-6 PM at the b
 ar for half price select tacos and house margaritas! It's the perfect way 
 to wrap up your work day or grab a drink with friends! Choose from any of 
 our scratch-made house margarita flavors and six of our favorite tacos! *D
 ine in only\, select items only from 3-6 PM every day. Bar seating only*\n
 \nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/half-price-tacos-and-hous
 e-margs-at-yellow-door-taqueria!/111221/
LOCATION:Yellow Door Taqueria\, 191 Dorrance Street\, Providence\, RI 0290
 3
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/half-price-tacos-and-house-marg
 s-at-yellow-door-taqueria!/111221/
