  at the opening reception. Image: “Moon and Fog” by Tatiana Roulin ”
  Spring Bull Gallery Exceptional Fine Art Since 1990 Open daily except Tue
 sdays\, 12:00 to 5:00 PM 55 Bellevue Ave\, Newport\, RI 02840 401-849-9166
 \n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/nocturnes-exhibit-at-sp
 ring-bull-gallery/111782/
